{"source":"/*\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\ntitle      UI Variables                                    +\nproject    nord-atom-ui                                    +\nrepository https://github.com/arcticicestudio/nord-atom-ui +\nauthor     Arctic Ice Studio                               +\nemail      development@arcticicestudio.com                 +\ncopyright  Copyright (C) 2016                              +\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n[Index]\n  > Animations\n  > Base\n      Background\n      Text\n  > Components\n      Button\n      Gutter\n      Input\n      Overlay\n      Pane\n      Panel\n      Progress Indicator\n      Scrollbar\n      Site\n      Tab\n      Tooltip\n      Tree View\n  > Configurations\n  > Fonts\n  > Package Support\n      build\n      imdone-atom\n      markdown-preview\n  > Sizes\n      Base\n      Font\n      Input\n      Tab\n*/\n/*+---------+\n  + Imports +\n  +---------+*/\n/*\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\ntitle      Nord                                    +\nproject    nord                                    +\nversion    0.1.0                                   +\nrepository https://github.com/arcticicestudio/nord +\nauthor     Arctic Ice Studio                       +\nemail      development@arcticicestudio.com         +\ncopyright  Copyright (C) 2016                      +\n++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\n[References]\nKSS\n  (http://warpspire.com/kss)\nkss-node\n  (https://github.com/kss-node/kss-node)\n*/\n/*+------------+\n  + Animations +\n  +------------+*/\n/*+------+\n  + Base +\n  +------+*/\n/*+--- Background ---+*/\n/*+--- Text ---+*/\n/*+------------+\n  + Components +\n  +------------+*/\n/*+--- Button ---+*/\n/*+--- Gutter ---+*/\n/*+--- Input ---+*/\n/*+--- Overlay ---+*/\n/*+--- Pane ---+*/\n/*+--- Panel ---+*/\n/*+--- Progress Indicator ---+*/\n/*+--- Scrollbar ---+*/\n/*+--- Site ---+*/\n/*+--- Tab ---+*/\n/*+--- Tooltip ---+*/\n/*+--- Tree View ---+*/\n/*+----------------+\n  + Configurations +\n  +----------------+*/\n/*+-------+\n  + Fonts +\n  +-------+*/\n/*+-----------------+\n  + Package Support +\n  +-----------------+*/\n/*+--- build ---+*/\n/*+--- imdone-atom ---+*/\n/*+--- indent-guide-improved ---+*/\n/*+--- markdown-preview ---+*/\n/*+--- tool-bar ---+*/\n/*+-------+\n  + Sizes +\n  +-------+*/\n/*+--- Base ---+*/\n/*+--- Font ---+*/\n/*+--- Input ---+*/\n/*+--- List ---+*/\n/*+--- Tab ---+*/\n.git-plus .error {\n  color: #d08770;\n}\n.git-plus .success {\n  color: #a3be8c;\n}\n.git-plus .atom-panel.modal.from-bottom {\n  width: 600px;\n}\n.git-plus.info-view {\n  overflow: auto;\n  max-height: 30vh;\n}\n.git-plus.info-view .output {\n  background-color: inherit;\n}\n.select-list-buttons {\n  margin-top: 5px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\natom-text-editor .syntax--diff .syntax--unimportant,\natom-text-editor.editor .syntax--diff .syntax--unimportant {\n  color: #5c5c5b;\n}\natom-text-editor .syntax--diff .syntax--info,\natom-text-editor.editor .syntax--diff .syntax--info {\n  color: #e6db74;\n}\natom-text-editor .syntax--diff .syntax--deletion,\natom-text-editor.editor .syntax--diff .syntax--deletion {\n  color: #f92672;\n}\natom-text-editor .syntax--diff .syntax--insertion,\natom-text-editor.editor .syntax--diff .syntax--insertion {\n  color: #529b2f;\n}\natom-text-editor .syntax--diff .syntax--markup.syntax--removed.syntax--diff,\natom-text-editor.editor .syntax--diff .syntax--markup.syntax--removed.syntax--diff,\natom-text-editor .syntax--diff .syntax--meta.syntax--diff.syntax--header.syntax--from-file,\natom-text-editor.editor .syntax--diff .syntax--meta.syntax--diff.syntax--header.syntax--from-file {\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #f92672;\n}\natom-text-editor .syntax--diff .syntax--markup.syntax--added.syntax--diff,\natom-text-editor.editor .syntax--diff .syntax--markup.syntax--added.syntax--diff,\natom-text-editor .syntax--diff .syntax--meta.syntax--diff.syntax--header.syntax--to-file,\natom-text-editor.editor .syntax--diff .syntax--meta.syntax--diff.syntax--header.syntax--to-file {\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #529b2f;\n}\n.git-plus-log {\n  background-color: #2e3440;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n}\n.git-plus-log #git-plus-commits {\n  width: 100%;\n  color: #d8dee9;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.git-plus-log #git-plus-commits td {\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n  vertical-align: top;\n}\n.git-plus-log #git-plus-commits .author {\n  width: 30%;\n}\n.git-plus-log #git-plus-commits .date {\n  width: 25%;\n}\n.git-plus-log #git-plus-commits .message {\n  width: 50%;\n}\n.git-plus-log #git-plus-commits .hashShort {\n  width: 10%;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n.git-plus-log .show-more {\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.git-plus-log #show-more {\n  padding-top: 10px;\n}\n.status-bar .git-branch {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.status-bar .git-branch:hover {\n  color: #eceff4;\n}\n"}